T0124 "Wire up 8 dead encoder presets": premise re-audited, real gap fixed.

Premise audit (grep evidence):
  - All ten EncoderPreset values were ALREADY reachable in C++:
    VideoSettings::presetName() had all ten cases; parseEncoderPreset() in
    EncoderSettings.cpp and encoderPresetFromSlug() in RenderExecutor.cpp each
    accepted all ten (medium as the unknown/default). So "8 dead presets" was
    stale. The QML model, however, listed only NINE -- placebo was absent.
  - The TODO body ("9:16/4:5/1:1 interesting additions. Risk: projectM aspect
    correction never exercised at 9:16") is about ASPECT RATIOS, not encoder
    presets. It belongs to no matching TODO item and is recorded in TODO.md as
    a discovery needing an owner/product decision; no speculative code.

Real defect fixed: the Settings ComboBox could not select `placebo`, and the
slug<->enum vocabulary existed as four independent hand-written lists with no
drift guard.

Change:
  - src/recorder/EncoderSettings.hpp: added
      inline constexpr std::array<std::string_view,10> kEncoderPresetSlugs
      encoderPresetSlug(EncoderPreset) / encoderPresetFromSlug(string_view)
    Unknown or empty slug -> EncoderPreset::Medium (historical default of every
    parser replaced). Both constexpr, header-only, no new TU or link edge.
  - EncoderSettings.cpp: removed the anonymous-namespace parseEncoderPreset;
    presetName() now returns encoderPresetSlug(preset); fromConfig() uses
    encoderPresetFromSlug(recCfg.video.preset).
  - RenderExecutor.cpp: removed its duplicate encoderPresetFromSlug; the job
    parser calls vc::encoderPresetFromSlug(job.encoderPreset).
  - src/qml/panels/settings/RecordingSettings.qml: added "placebo" to model.
  - tests/unit/recorder/test_RecordingPipeline.cpp: two new slots,
      encoderPresetSlugsRoundTripAndAreComplete
        - static_assert table size == enum count
        - for all 10: slug non-empty, equals table[i], inverse round-trips,
        - all slugs distinct, "" / "nonsense" / "ULTRAFAST" -> Medium,
        - presetName(Placebo) == "placebo"
      qmlPresetModelMatchesTheCanonicalSlugs
        - reads the REAL RecordingSettings.qml via CHADVIS_SOURCE_DIR,
        - locates the `model: ["ultrafast"...]` array, asserts every canonical
          slug appears and that there are no extra quoted entries.

